  "details": "When in FBT mode there are options to move/rotate your trackers under advanced options.\n\nAfter the trackers turn off / disconnect all FBT related options disappear, including the tracker move/rotate adjustment buttons.. \n\nRetaining the ability to make adjustments after freezing on disconnect would be very handy, especially if laying down or wanting to get comfy under blankets.\n\nSometimes thingsend up a bit pretzel, or you start laying another way and want to rotate your chest to align better.",
